NOTICE ON DISPLAYED DATA

The MIT licence above covers the dashboard code only. The incident data this
dashboard renders (vendored under data/snapshot/ and shown on the published
site) is NOT covered by it. That data is the Agentic Attack Index, published by
MLSecOpsHub at https://github.com/MLSecOpsHub/agentic-attack-index, and is
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
licence (CC BY-SA 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).

Any reuse of the data, including screenshots or exports of this dashboard that
contain it, must attribute "Agentic Attack Index (MLSecOpsHub)" with a link to
the repository above and must be shared under the same licence.

The vendored map geometry under data/geo/ is Natural Earth data (public domain)
packaged by world-atlas (ISC licence, Copyright 2013-2019 Michael Bostock).
